"(rr) "wages" means all remuneration capable of being expressed in terms of money,
which would, if the terms of employment, expressed or implied, were fulfilled, be payable to a workman in respect of his employment or of work done in such employment, and includes- (i) such allowances (including dearness allowance) as the workman is for the time being entitled to;
